The '''Natural Historian''' is found with the [[Varrock Museum]] expedition on [[Mount Quidamortem]], along with [[Historian Duffy]], [[Gnosi]], and the [[Mountain Guide]].

During [[Tale of the Righteous]], he accompanies [[Gnosi]] and the [[Historian Duffy]] into the [[Quidamortem Cave|cave]] west of the Mountain. After the quest, he remains in the cave to further study the temple.

